   "en": "The mishna teaches: If the rebellious elder «returned to his city and he taught» in the manner that he was teaching previously, he is exempt from punishment, unless he instructs others to act on the basis of his ruling. «The Sages taught: He is not liable unless he acts in accordance with his ruling, or he instructs others and they act in accordance with his ruling.»"
